performance gaps vary from 4pp (Russian-native GigaChat3) to 28pp (GPT), suggesting that training language composition may matter more than model scale.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.29003/2075-7182-2026-24-153-162", "type": "proceedings-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2026, 6, 24]], "date-time": "2026-06-24T17:19:17Z", "timestamp": 1782321557000}, "page": "153-162", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["WorkBench-RU: Can Agents Solve Multi-Step Workplace Tasks Beyond English?"], "prefix": "10.29003", "author": [{"given": "Timur", "family": "Ionov", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [{"name": "ITMO University"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Valentin", "family": "Malykh", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "ITMO University"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "11544", "event": {"name": "Dialogue", "acronym": "Dialogue"}, "container-title": ["Computational Linguistics and Intellectual Technologies"], "original-title": ["WorkBench-RU: \u0421\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u044f\u044e\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043b\u0438 \u0430\u0433\u0435\u043d\u0442\u044b \u0441 \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e\u0448\u0430\u0433\u043e\u0432\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0447\u0438\u043c\u0438 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0437\u0430 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u043c\u0438 \u0430\u043d\u0433\u043b\u0438\u0439\u0441\u043a\u043e\u0433\u043e \u044f\u0437\u044b\u043a\u0430?"], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 6, 24]], "date-time": "2026-06-24T17:19:18Z", "timestamp": 1782321558000}, "score": 28.099377, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://dialogue-conf.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Dialog2026-2.pdf#page=161"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2026, 6, 19]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.29003/2075-7182-2026-24-153-162", "published": {"date-parts": [[2026, 6, 19]]}}], "items-per-page": 5, "query": {"start-index": 